      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Reaction-Time Test</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg: #1e1e2f;\n      --card-bg: #2d2d44;\n      --text: #e0e0e0;\n      --accent: #4caf50;\n      --accent-hover: #66bb6a;\n      --accent-pressed: #388e3c;\n      --danger: #f44336;\n      --border-radius: 12px;\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .card {\n      background: var(--card-bg);\n      border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n      padding: 32px 24px;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 480px;\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      font-size: 1.8rem;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    .subtitle {\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      opacity: 0.8;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n\n    #box {\n      width: 100%;\n      aspect-ratio: 2 / 1;\n      background: #3a3a55;\n      border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      font-size: 1.5rem;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;\n      user-select: none;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n      border: 2px solid transparent;\n    }\n\n    #box:hover {\n      background: #4a4a6a;\n    }\n\n    #box:focus-visible {\n      outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n      outline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n\n    #box.ready {\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    #box.ready:hover {\n      background: var(--accent-hover);\n    }\n\n    #box.ready:active {\n      background: var(--accent-pressed);\n      transform: scale(0.98);\n    }\n\n    #box.too-soon {\n      background: var(--danger);\n      color: #fff;\n    }\n\n    .controls {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 12px;\n      justify-content: center;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n\n    button {\n      font-family: inherit;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n      padding: 12px 24px;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: #fff;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;\n      min-width: 120px;\n    }\n\n    button:hover {\n      background: var(--accent-hover);\n    }\n\n    button:active {\n      background: var(--accent-pressed);\n      transform: scale(0.97);\n    }\n\n    button:focus-visible {\n      outline: 3px solid var(--accent);\n      outline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n\n    button:disabled {\n      opacity: 0.5;\n      cursor: not-allowed;\n      transform: none;\n    }\n\n    .stats {\n      margin-top: 24px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 8px;\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\n    }\n\n    .stats span {\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    #message {\n      min-height: 1.5em;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n\n    #message.error {\n      color: var(--danger);\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 400px) {\n      .card {\n        padding: 24px 16px;\n      }\n      h1 {\n        font-size: 1.5rem;\n      }\n      #box {\n        font-size: 1.2rem;\n      }\n      button {\n        font-size: 1rem;\n        padding: 10px 20px;\n        min-width: 100px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Reaction-Time Test</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Click the box when it turns green!</p>\n\n    <div id=\"box\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Reaction test box. Press Start, then click or press Enter/Space when the box turns green.\">\n      Click Start\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"startBtn\" aria-label=\"Start the reaction test\">Start</button>\n      <button id=\"resetBtn\" aria-label=\"Reset the test and clear best time\">Reset</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"stats\">\n      <div id=\"message\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n      <div>Reaction time: <span id=\"reactionTime\">—</span></div>\n      <div>Best time: <span id=\"bestTime\">—</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    (function() {\n      'use strict';\n\n      const box = document.getElementById('box');\n      const startBtn = document.getElementById('startBtn');\n      const resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetBtn');\n      const messageEl = document.getElementById('message');\n      const reactionTimeEl = document.getElementById('reactionTime');\n      const bestTimeEl = document.getElementById('bestTime');\n\n      let state = 'idle'; // idle, waiting, ready, tooSoon, done\n      let timeoutId = null;\n      let startTime = 0;\n      let bestTime = null;\n\n      // Load best time from localStorage\n      try {\n        const stored = localStorage.getItem('reactionBestTime');\n        if (stored) {\n          bestTime = parseInt(stored, 10);\n          bestTimeEl.textContent = bestTime + ' ms';\n        }\n      } catch (e) {\n        // localStorage unavailable\n      }\n\n      function setMessage(text, isError) {\n        messageEl.textContent = text;\n        messageEl.classList.toggle('error', !!isError);\n      }\n\n      function resetBox() {\n        box.className = '';\n        box.textContent = 'Click Start';\n      }\n\n      function startTest() {\n        if (state === 'waiting' || state === 'ready') return;\n        clearTimeout(timeoutId);\n        state = 'waiting';\n        box.className = '';\n        box.textContent = 'Wait...';\n        setMessage('');\n        reactionTimeEl.textContent = '—';\n        startBtn.disabled = true;\n\n        const delay = 1000 + Math.random() * 4000; // 1–5 seconds\n        timeoutId = setTimeout(() => {\n          state = 'ready';\n          box.className = 'ready';\n          box.textContent = 'Click!';\n          startTime = performance.now();\n        }, delay);\n      }\n\n      function handleBoxClick() {\n        if (state === 'waiting') {\n          // Too soon\n          clearTimeout(timeoutId);\n          state = 'tooSoon';\n          box.className = 'too-soon';\n          box.textContent = 'Too soon!';\n          setMessage('Too soon! Wait for green.', true);\n          startBtn.disabled = false;\n          // Reset after a short delay\n          setTimeout(() => {\n            if (state === 'tooSoon') {\n              state = 'idle';\n              resetBox();\n            }\n          }, 1500);\n          return;\n        }\n\n        if (state === 'ready') {\n          const reaction = Math.round(performance.now() - startTime);\n          state = 'done';\n          box.className = '';\n          box.textContent = reaction + ' ms';\n          reactionTimeEl.textContent = reaction + ' ms';\n          setMessage('Nice!');\n          startBtn.disabled = false;\n\n          if (bestTime === null || reaction < bestTime) {\n            bestTime = reaction;\n            bestTimeEl.textContent = bestTime + ' ms';\n            try {\n              localStorage.setItem('reactionBestTime', bestTime);\n            } catch (e) {\n              // ignore\n            }\n            setMessage('New best time!');\n          }\n        }\n      }\n\n      function resetTest() {\n        clearTimeout(timeoutId);\n        state = 'idle';\n        resetBox();\n        setMessage('');\n        reactionTimeEl.textContent = '—';\n        startBtn.disabled = false;\n        // Clear best time\n        bestTime = null;\n        bestTimeEl.textContent = '—';\n        try {\n          localStorage.removeItem('reactionBestTime');\n        } catch (e) {\n          // ignore\n        }\n      }\n\n      // Event listeners\n      startBtn.addEventListener('click', startTest);\n      resetBtn.addEventListener('click', resetTest);\n\n      box.addEventListener('click', handleBoxClick);\n\n      box.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n        if (e.key === 'Enter' || e.key === ' ') {\n          e.preventDefault();\n          handleBoxClick();\n        }\n      });\n\n      // Prevent space from scrolling when box is focused\n      box.addEventListener('keyup', (e) => {\n        if (e.key === ' ') {\n          e.preventDefault();\n        }\n      });\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Reaction-Time Test\n\nA minimal, offline browser-based reaction time test. Click the box when it turns green and see your reaction time in milliseconds. Try to beat your best time!\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern web browser.\n2. Click the **Start** button.\n3. Wait for the box to turn green (after a random delay of 1–5 seconds).\n4. Click the box (or press Enter/Space when focused) as soon as it turns green.\n5. Your reaction time is displayed in milliseconds.\n6. If you click too early, you'll see \"Too soon!\" and need to start again.\n7. Your best time is saved locally and displayed.\n8. Use the **Reset** button to clear your best time.\n\n## Features\n\n- Fully offline – no network requests, external assets, or dependencies.\n- Keyboard accessible – use Tab to navigate, Enter/Space to activate.\n- Responsive design – works from 360px width and up.\n- Clean, modern UI with hover, focus, and pressed states.\n- Best time persisted via localStorage (when available).\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – the complete application (HTML, CSS, JS inline).\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
